        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Fast wind, slow wind, fuck, yeah, we behaving bad, uh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Probably couldn't tell, but I be blushing when you with me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "When you kiss me, swear to God, blood was rushing to my Jimmy, uh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Laying on my trampoline, looking at the stars",
          "rhyme": "aR",
