        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "From my fake space fog machine",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Laying on my arm, it's dead",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "From the pressure of your head",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I said I loved you, said it back",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Like it was scripted, but you meant it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Like the flavor of that lemonade",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "That we was sipping on our sushi-ridden dinner date",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Oh, you think you special now? Other bitches trippin' now",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "'Cause we're fleeing to the moon, fuck Earth, man, we sick of y'all",
